{"subject":"phi_{nl}(theta)","relation":"proves","object":"phi_{nl}(theta) = (cos(theta/2))^{l+1}(sin(theta/2))^l P^{(N/2+l-1,N/2+l)}_{n-l}(cos theta)","modality":"stated","locator":"Eq. (3.27)"}
