{"subject":"normalisation constant |c_N(nl)|^{-2}","relation":"proves","object":"|c_N(nl)|^{-2} = 2^{N-2}|Gamma(N/2+n)|^2 / ((n-l)! (N+n+l-1)!)","modality":"stated","locator":"Eq. (3.44)"}
