{"subject":"c_l(lambda)","relation":"defines","object":"c_l(lambda) = 2^{N-2}/sqrt(pi) * Gamma(N/2+l) Gamma(1/2+i lambda)/Gamma(N/2+l+i lambda)","modality":"stated","locator":"Eq. (3.76)"}
{"subject":"mu(lambda)","relation":"equivalent-to","object":"|c_0(lambda)|^{-2}","modality":"stated","locator":"Eq. (3.79)"}
