{"subject":"heat kernel on H^N","relation":"proves","object":"hat f_N(y,t) = 2^{N-3}Gamma(N/2)/pi^{N/2+1} integral phi_lambda(y) e^{-t lambda^2} mu(lambda) dlambda","modality":"stated","locator":"Eq. (4.26)"}
