{"subject":"trace of heat kernel","relation":"proves","object":"Tr[K(x_0,x,t)U(x,x_0)] = (1/d_tau) sum_lambda d_lambda phi^lambda_tau(sigma(x)) e^{-t omega_lambda}","modality":"stated","locator":"Eq. (5.23)"}
